 Cultivar groups 
{{See also|Camellia hiemalis|Camellia × vernalis|Camellia oleifera}}
Based on flowering period, flower form, genetic background, and ecological habit, Naoki Hakoda divided the cultivars of Camellia sasanqua into three main groups. Chinese scholars later added a fourth group (the Oleifera Group).{{rp|39-40}}
